I'm inclined to think that it would be better if the epitaph _were_
displayed in the high score list - it would give you a chance to
write excuses for your really embarrassing deaths. Next time a
19th-level character gets killed by a newt, you can _explain_ that
there were five mastodons involved as well and the newt just
happened to get in the killing hit. If you choke on a black dragon
corpse, you can write `typo' or `forgot I had my AoR on instead of
my AoMB' or `no, I really am that stupid' as appropriate.

Better still, if you get killed by a newt and _don't_ have a good
excuse, you can make one up and nobody will know! Unless a bones
file happens to be generated with a tell-tale lack of mastodons, of
course... ;-)
